  "fullDescription": "Retro Dream is a refined high-contrast serif typeface designed for luxury branding, editorial design, and sophisticated visual identities.\n\nInspired by contemporary fashion typography and timeless editorial aesthetics, Retro Dream blends sharp elegance with delicate curves. The contrast between thick and thin strokes creates a dramatic yet graceful presence, making it perfect for premium brands and artistic layouts.\n\nIts distinctive letterforms — especially in characters like R, A, M, and S — bring personality while maintaining balance and readability.\n\nPerfect for designers who want impact without losing elegance.\n\nPerfect For:\n• Fashion branding\n• Luxury logos\n• Editorial layouts\n• Magazine headlines\n• Beauty & cosmetic packaging\n• Wedding design\n• High-end social media visuals\n• Modern serif logo design\n\nCarefully spaced and optimized for both print and digital use.\n\nRetro Dream delivers timeless sophistication with a modern edge.",
